    "name_raw": "Ancestral Scorn",
    "definition_type_raw": null,
    "source_book_raw": "Blood of Fiends pg. 24",
    "definition_raw": "Source Blood of Fiends pg. 24\nThe fury you harbor for your fiendish ancestors gives evil outsiders great reason to fear you.\n\nPrerequisites: Intimidate 5 ranks, tiefling.\n\nBenefit: Whenever you successfully demoralize an outsider of the evil subtype with an Intimidate check, it becomes sickened for 1 round in addition to being affected by the normal effects of being demoralized. If you beat the DC by 5 or more, the creature is nauseated for 1 round instead.\n\nNormal: Demoralizing a foe with a successful Intimidate check causes it to become shaken for 1 round, +1 round for every 5 by which you beat the DC.",
    "links_raw": [
      {
        "anchor_text_raw": "Blood of Fiends pg. 24",
